Package: cutter
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Reverse engineering platform powered by Rizin
 Cutter is a graphical reverse engineering platform built on the Rizin
 framework. This package builds Cutter and its bundled Rizin from source for
 arm64, where upstream publishes no Linux build. Rizin is installed privately
 under /usr/lib/cutter, so its command-line tools are not added to PATH.
